# SEO & GEO

Follow `skills/seo-geo.md` for any blog or public marketing SEO work.

## Must ship with blog/public pages

- Unique `title` + `description` + canonical via `DocumentHead`
- OG/Twitter tags with **absolute** image URLs
- JSON-LD: `BlogPosting` + `BreadcrumbList` (+ `FAQPage` if FAQs)
- Visible GEO blocks: key takeaways + FAQ (not schema-only)
- `datePublished` / `dateModified`, author, organization entity
- Keep `public/robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, `llms.txt` aligned with routes

## Do not

- Keyword stuffing or multiple H1s
- Relative `og:image` / schema `image`
- `noindex` on published blog URLs
- SEO fields only in head with empty thin body content
